				<guid>https://x3ero0.github.io/games/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Here is a list of every game on my gamestation, most recently played first.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I have a strict policy of mostly playing single-player games to keep my sanity intact. That said, I still enjoy a good LAN party with my IRL friends, so I do make room for LAN multiplayer games. Those are usually older PC games from the era when local area network support was common. These days, a proper LAN option in a multiplayer game feels almost as rare as modern games shipping on physical disks. And yes, I absolutely love both LAN games and physical editions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
